---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Star Wars Outlaws — Cross-Platform Buying Guide"
  description="Star Wars Outlaws buying guide: Ubisoft's open-world Star Wars game, editions, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Star Wars Outlaws — Cross-Platform Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Xbox / PS5 / PC · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Star Wars Outlaws</strong> is Ubisoft's open-world Star Wars game — the
      first of its kind — putting you in the boots of scoundrel Kay Vess across a string
      of famous and original planets.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Ultimate</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game</li>
      <li><strong>Ultimate / Season Pass</strong> — adds story drops (including a Kijimi adventure) and cosmetics; buy if you want the extra content</li>
      <li><strong>Story upgrades</strong> — a few free updates added new mode content; no paid wall blocks the main story</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      A 2024 release, Outlaws sees deepening key-store discounts on Green Man Gaming that
      undercut the Ubisoft Store and console stores. A GMG key is usually the cheapest
      permanent copy.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=star+wars+outlaws"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Star+Wars+Outlaws"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
